# Dev-only wallet shim config (see src/devwallet.ts).
#
# Optional. Used only when the app is opened with `?dev-wallet=1` in the URL.
# Point it at the disposable MONAD TESTNET key used by the spike/core scripts
# (spike/.env) so reads, previews and tx-failure flows run against real
# balances on-chain.
#
#   VITE_DEV_WALLET_KEY=0x...
#
# Never put a real private key here, and never enable this in production.